@startuml diagrama_relop
title Diagrama de Transicao — RELOP + AT (relacionais e atribuicao)
' Slide 14 (estados 0..10). Implementado em getRelop().
' Estados finais com '*' fazem lookahead (retract). '=' isolado => AT.

skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #FDFDFD
  BorderColor #333333
  ArrowColor #333333
  FontName "Helvetica"
}

[*] --> s0 : inicio
state "0" as s0
state "1" as s1
state "2  RELOP <=" as s2 <<accepting>>
state "3 *  RELOP <" as s3 <<accepting>>
state "4" as s4
state "5  RELOP ==" as s5 <<accepting>>
state "6 *  AT =" as s6 <<accepting>>
state "7" as s7
state "8  RELOP >=" as s8 <<accepting>>
state "9 *  RELOP >" as s9b <<accepting>>
state "10" as s10
state "11  RELOP !=" as s11 <<accepting>>

' --- ramo '<' ---
s0 --> s1 : <
s1 --> s2  : =
s1 --> s3  : outro

' --- ramo '=' ---
s0 --> s4 : =
s4 --> s5 : =
s4 --> s6 : outro

' --- ramo '>' ---
s0 --> s7 : >
s7 --> s8  : =
s7 --> s9b : outro

' --- ramo '!' ---
s0 --> s10 : !
s10 --> s11 : =

note right of s6
  Diferenca-chave:
  '=' seguido de outro
  nao-'=' => TK_AT
  (atribuicao), nao RELOP.
  '!' isolado => TK_ERRO.
end note
@enduml
